    },
    {
      question: "Do you certify our system against SOC 2 or ISO 27001?",
      answer: "No. Our methodology is aligned with SOC 2 and ISO 27001 controls, and we can map the controls in the software we build to those frameworks so your auditor has what they need. Certification is done by an accredited auditor, and whether your system meets a standard is for them to confirm.",
