      question: "What is application security testing?",
      answer: "Application security testing checks your own software for weaknesses attackers could exploit. It combines static analysis of source code, dependency scanning for known vulnerable libraries, dynamic testing of the running application, and manual penetration testing of the logic automated tools miss, such as broken access control between users.",
    },
